SUMMARY:[Curated Role Feeds] Page updated: Maine Board of Overseers of the
  Bar — General News
DESCRIPTION:This page's content changed since the last check. Visit the pa
 ge directly to review the update.\n\nWhat changed (text excerpt):\nAdded:\
 n  + Extended Registration\n  + Attorney license renewal and Guardian ad L
 item license renewal may be completed in the MyBoardAccess portal from Sep
 tember 9 through October 30\, 2026 at 5:00 pm.\n  + Pursuant to M. Bar R. 
 4\,\n  + Registration documents and payments received after August 31st wi
 ll be assessed a non-waivable late fee.\n  + Please note that license rene
 wal requires current contact information\, including a physical residence 
 address\, accurate practice type (private\, government\, judicial\, etc.)\
 , proxy designation for all private practitioners\, and IOLTA account list
 ing or an accurate IOLTA exemption.\n  + If your status has changed since 
 last year (no longer a law clerk\, are retired seeking Inactive\, new judg
 e or seeking to become active again)\, please contact execassistant@mebaro
 verseers.org to request a status change\n  + before you register in the po
 rtal.\n  + Registration is completed online on the\n  + MyBoardAccess\n  +
  by clicking on the Renew Registration section of the Board's web portal.\
 nhttps://www.mebaroverseers.org/
URL:https://www.mebaroverseers.org/
